	heroObjectPosition={`center center`}
	directAnswerHtml={`<strong style="color: var(--color-ink);">The best Bible to give a new believer, or a friend who is still deciding, is a clear modern translation they will actually read, with a simple place to start: the Gospel of John.</strong> The <a href="https://fathersheartbible.com/read/" style="color: var(--color-brand);" class="hover:underline">Father's Heart Bible™ (FHB)</a>, which we publish, is free to read and <em>listen to</em> online with no account and no pressure, and it reveals God as a <em>Father</em>, not the distant, angry scorekeeper many people walked away from. The NLT and NIV are trusted, readable alternatives, and The Message is a contemporary paraphrase some readers enjoy alongside a translation; the comparison below sets them side by side. If you left, or were never in, you are invited to read for yourself and decide: no membership, no agenda.`}
